+/**
+ * [Mines-38.8] an 账号异常 card whose problem is gone: the account's latest patrol check is OK again, or the card's own
+ * words say it was solved (「权限问题已解决：异常已排除」). Such a card shows as the green 「已解决」 card (check, 收起)
